// Portfolio-planning probe scenario for Worldwake.
//
// Purpose: prove the landed S112 portfolio branch with one rejected survival
// slot, one rejected commitment slot, and one plausible economic slot on the
// same planning tick.
//
// Authored world shape:
// - Camp Workshop is the agent's only place and contains the lawful economic
//   opportunity:
//   - `Bake Bread` via `Camp Mill` + Planner-carried `Firewood`
//
// The scenario itself does not author persisted belief state or prior
// commitment. The golden harness seeds those explicit proof
// inputs so the test can exercise the live commitment-slot and
// feasibility-probe contracts without widening the scenario schema.
//
// Lawful competing affordances intentionally removed from setup:
// - no travel graph complexity
// - no combat, politics, trade, or social branches
// - no alternate workstation family or second recipe
// - no local sleep support, so `Sleep` can be tested as a probe rejection
// - no extra commodity or social support beyond the seeded expectation record
